# 19. Background Jobs & Automation

The backend must support scheduled operations.

| Automation | Frequency | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| EOD reminder | Daily at 20:00 | Notify members with pending submissions |
| Carry-forward | Daily on working-day transition | Move incomplete work forward |
| Stale work detection | Daily | Identify work without updates |
| Overdue ticket detection | Daily | Identify tickets past target dates |
| Reminder retry | Configurable | Retry failed email delivery |
| Data consistency check | Daily | Detect missing or inconsistent references |
| Weekly summary | Weekly | Generate team activity summary |

All scheduled jobs must be safe to run more than once without creating duplicate records or sending duplicate successful reminders.

